OOF Factorial — recursive function demo
OOF Shows: MAGIC, GIVEBACK, recursion (Turing completeness!)

MAGIC factorial(n)
    IFF n SMALLR IS 1
        GIVEBACK 1
    UGHA
    GIVEBACK n TIMES factorial(n MINUS 1)
UGHA

OOF Print factorials from 0 to 12
OOGA i BE 0
UGGA WHILE i SMALLR IS 12
    SAY WORDY(i) PLUS "! = " PLUS WORDY(factorial(i))
    i GETS i PLUS 1
UGHA
